      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ONE MORE REASON (7) cops a tough gate for his return, and he has won a trial leading into this at Young, albeit against nothing of note. Jason Grimson takes over the training, and that usually means instant success, so follow the money trails. HIGHINDELIGHT (5) has been racing in terrific form and deserved her latest victory, when scoring by 3.5 metres over 1609m here. This is a stronger line-up, but she is going well enough to handle the rise in grade and looks the one to beat. KRUSTY KRUNCH (3) bounced back with a solid third at Bathurst last time and gets an ideal draw here. This is tougher, but her best form gives her a genuine chance. WHERES MY REASON (6) has been consistently competitive and comes off another sound third over this track and trip. Hard to fault and should be right in the finish. ENOLA (9) was honest when fourth over 2138m at Albion Park last time and can figure in the minors with the right run.",
